  "description": "CentralWatch API monitoring. Breaks down HTTP traffic (from centralwatch_http_server_duration_milliseconds) by route, method and status code; shows P95 latency per route, the error ratio (HTTP 5xx), the request-duration histogram and a table of the slowest APIs. Route, method and status variables are populated from the live histogram labels.",
